# The uploads EiN freezes as they arrive, through the web interface or SFTP: one mimetype per line,
# `type/*` for every subtype, `!` before a type to leave it out. A frozen file's content cannot be
# written, in EiN or on the disk, until someone lifts the mark with `attrs -d frozen <file>`.
# What EiN writes itself is never frozen by this file. Leave it empty to freeze no upload.

image/*
video/*
audio/*

# An SVG is a text file that can hold a script.
!image/svg+xml
